        <mxCell id="legendBody" value="━━━ (주황, 굵게) : AWS → Tanzu 단방향 접근, AWS Direct Connect&#10;&#10;           AWS ECS / Lambda / EMR (10.253.162.64/26 · 10.253.162.192/26)&#10;              → MySQL (x.x.x.x : xxxx 미정)&#10;              → RabbitMQ (10.10.41.211 : 5672)&#10;              → Elasticsearch (10.10.41.210 : 443, DNS: h-cloud-api.hanwhalife.com, h-cloud-elasticsearch.hanwhalife.com)&#10;&#10;┈┈┈ (점선) : 외부 Kubernetes → Tanzu DevOps Cluster Harbor (h-harbor.hanwhalife.com) 이미지 Pull, 단방향 HTTPS 443&#10;           • Azure AKS (파랑)      • NCP 민간 NKS (초록)      • NCP 금융 NKS 10.239.193.64/26 (초록, 금융망 전용선)&#10;&#10;※ 금융망 격리 : NCP 금융존 ↔ NCP 민간존 / Azure / AWS 직접 통신 없음. 모든 이미지는 Tanzu Harbor 경유." style="text;fontSize=12;align=left;spacingLeft=20;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
